457
00:36:11.209 --> 00:36:14.587
Maar ik ben geen koning.
Ik ben slechts je zoon.

458
00:36:15.046 --> 00:36:16.347
Obasi.

459
00:36:17.048 --> 00:36:18.299
Chigaru.

460
00:36:18.466 --> 00:36:19.768
Obasi.

461
00:36:20.051 --> 00:36:23.805
